COOLBOY12 — FIELD-DEFINITION SCHEMA (structural contract)

ARTIFACT 073 · FIELD-DEFINITION schema · docs/registry/field_definition.schema · Own: R ·
RM: R · T: schema · R: CONTRACT · SoT: AUTHORITATIVE · Auth: defining ·
Canon: canonical-about-meaning · CD: yes · Ph/St: P3/3b · Req: RR-27 · BP: §9.4 · RMS: §10.1 ·
